                <p class="fs-primary-subhead cs-width-75">Using AI for the documentation layer kept the specs faithful to the tested prototype, and I spent my time on decisions instead of transcription.</p>
                <img src="/assets/uploads/timely-sections/Annotated%20Design.png" alt="Figma design of the expanded section type editor, annotated with development notes for each behavior" class="cs-width-75">
